    {
      "source": "Simple <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/dao/support/PersistenceExceptionTranslator.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.dao.support\"><code>PersistenceExceptionTranslator</code></a> for Mongo. Convert the given runtime exception to an appropriate\nexception from the <code>org.springframework.dao</code> hierarchy. Return null if no translation is\nappropriate: any other exception may have resulted from user code, and should not be translated.",
      "translation": "为 MongoDB 提供简单的<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/dao/support/PersistenceExceptionTranslator.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.dao.support\"><code>PersistenceExceptionTranslator</code></a>。将给定的运行时异常转换为来自<code>org.springframework.dao</code>层次结构中的适当异常。如果不存在适当的转换，则返回 null：任何其他异常可能由用户代码引起，不应进行转换。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<code><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/dao/support/PersistenceExceptionTranslator.html#translateExceptionIfPossible(java.lang.RuntimeException)\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.dao.support\">translateExceptionIfPossible</a></code> in interface <code><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/dao/support/PersistenceExceptionTranslator.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.dao.support\">PersistenceExceptionTranslator</a></code>",
      "translation": "<code><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/dao/support/PersistenceExceptionTranslator.html#translateExceptionIfPossible(java.lang.RuntimeException)\" title=\"org.springframework.dao.support 中的类或接口\">translateExceptionIfPossible</a></code> 是接口 <code><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/dao/support/PersistenceExceptionTranslator.html\" title=\"org.springframework.dao.support 中的类或接口\">PersistenceExceptionTranslator</a></code> 中的一个方法。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "true if the given <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Exception.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>Exception</code></a> is a <code>MongoException</code> holding one of the transient\n        exception error labels.",
